# [[tern]] {{gloss|bird in the subfamily {{taxlink|Terninae|subfamily|ver=220923|nover=1}} of family [[Laridae]] - gulls and terns}}

====Usage notes====
* {{m|fi|räyskä||Caspian tern, ''Sterna caspia''}} is the only bird in this subfamily that does not have {{m|fi||tiira}} in its Finnish common name
* birds in the genus ''[[Anous]]'' that belongs to this subfamily are "[[noddy|noddies]]" in English

